<title>USA: NDE Environmental sells Ustman unit.</title>
<headline>NDE Environmental sells Ustman unit.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NDE Environmental Corp said that it sold its Ustman Industries Inc unit to Watson General Corp.</p>
<p>The company's Ustman Industries subsidiary was sold to Watson General on May 22 for a $5,250,000 cash payment and an eight percent note for $500,000 due in one year.</p>
<p>The sale agreement also provides for an additional payment to NDE relating to a post-closing adjustment based upon certain working capital calculations, NDE said.</p>
</text>
